    {
      "text": "Figure 5, \"Overview of NHWA implementation tools\". A four-quadrant panel presenting the four WHO tools that support country implementation of NHWA: at top left, \"NHWA Handbook — Sets of standards and norms on health workforce indicators\"; at top right, \"NHWA implementation guide — Step by step implementation for policy makers\"; at bottom left, \"NHWA web platform — Online platform for NHWA focal points to monitor and report their HWF statistics\"; and at bottom right, \"NHWA data portal — Public portal with data validated by countries\".",
